咖啡冷知識（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240606/875428574038069248471289.png/cPGB_9WLKmJYM2XEt0UPgqrPPjZ-Fcj2ggti7YILYu0\"/><figcaption>10個咖啡冷知識（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"10個咖啡冷知識（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240606/875428576185683968423960.png/uR0hT7EkWY8WmZLvRpWH23Ffl57Kmep7F_lsQBf5bEA\"/><figcaption>10個咖啡冷知識（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"10個咖啡冷知識（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240606/875428578559791104142358.png/enUv5y-mrj-ZR7wtWvupmtImv2sY3_x44Qu11OELtdQ\"/><figcaption>10個咖啡冷知識（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文經《風傳媒》授權轉載，原文：咖啡豆怎麼保存才不會受潮？專家教1招「久放仍香濃新鮮」：千萬不要放冰箱，一堆人做錯】</p><p>「本文內容反映原文作者的意見，並不代表《香港01》的立場。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T11:18:35.666248+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2118,"images":61,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}